TY  - JOUR
TI  - Towards a multi-purpose framework for tax-benefit microsimulation: Lessons from EUROMOD
AU  - Immervoll, Herwig
AU  - O’Donoghue, Cathal
VL  - 2
IS  - 2
PY  - 2009
DA  - 2009/12/31
